# 8.12 主要接口

**表8-1 配置及运行状态控制主要逻辑接口**

| 序号 | 接口 | 主要内容 | 要求 |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Software/APB → Config | Candidate Config、Apply Request | 只修改Shadow/Candidate |
| 2 | Config → Geometry | Resolved Candidate | Prepare不修改Active |
| 3 | Geometry → Config | Prepared Geometry、Pass/Reject | 在Safe Point前保持 |
| 4 | Integration → Config | Config Safe Point | 未满足不得Publish |
| 5 | Config/Geometry → MC | Active Config、Active Geometry | 原子发布 |
| 6 | MR → GS | MR Command Candidate | 仍需GS Final Admission |
| 7 | PI内部Event → MR | MR Registered-equivalent Event | 来自标准DFI Mapping |
| 8 | MRR Return → MR | Standard DFI Readback +内部Correlation | 不增加私有MRR Tag |
| 9 | FSP → MR/Timing/Training | Target Workpoint及Sequence State | Workpoint一致 |
| 10 | Power → GS | Admission Gate / Entry Sequence | 不修改BSM Truth |
| 11 | Refresh → Power | Maintenance Feasibility/Catch-up | Reopen条件之一 |
| 12 | DFI/PHY → Training | 标准DFI/正式PHY Result | Carrier由ICD确认 |
